  <p id="c-songshu-086-liumian:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-086-liumian:p001:m0000" ref="e2r_5iw_ui0_A">劉勔</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-086-liumian:p001:m0003" ref="e2r_5iw_ui0_A">伯猷</persName>，彭城人也。祖<persName id="c-songshu-086-liumian:p001:m0012" ref="77k_fav_cfn">懷義</persName>，始興太守。父<persName id="c-songshu-086-liumian:p001:m0021" ref="e2r_5iw_ui0">穎之</persName>，汝南、新蔡二郡太守，征林邑，遇疾卒。</p>
